From: openEuler RISC-V Maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 18:10:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] build: support CMake 3.27

openEuler 24.03 LTS SP3 provides CMake 3.27.9.  The 3.1.0 sources do
not use interfaces introduced in CMake 3.28, so retain the project's
existing configuration while permitting the target distribution's
CMake release.

---
 CMakeLists.txt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 2d05c8d..37891d8 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.28)
+cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.27)
 project(libsimplemail VERSION 3.1.0 LANGUAGES CXX)

 include(GNUInstallDirs)
--
2.51.0
